nRelated: GPU/frame-deferral umbrella da827f7; older russl/adapter CI tracker d35bfb3 is a separate earlier failure set. Evidence is under target/ci-68cd00c1/, including per-platform counts/diagnostics and pinned job IDs. The six GitHub issue intake tracks #79-#84 and excluded #63 are untouched by this monitoring work.","files":null}]}